Scope note
==========

The MIT grant below covers ONLY the files that belong to this project: the
build and packaging tools, the configuration, the documentation
and the tests in this repository.

It does not cover, and does not relicense:

  * the game "Digimon World: Dusk", any Nintendo DS ROM image,
    BIOS or firmware image (none of which are distributed here);
  * the ndsrecomp framework (https://github.com/mstan/ndsrecomp), which has its
    own license split: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 for project-owned code,
    plus MIT and GPL-3.0 parts including vendored melonDS sources. The file
    patches/ndsrecomp.patch modifies framework files and stays under the
    license of each file it touches;
  * recomp-ui (MIT) and the other third-party components listed in
    THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

An nds_runner built with this project links GPL-3.0 parts of the framework
and is therefore a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work. Because the framework is
noncommercial-only, so is the port as a whole.

